Subject: [PATCH] Gate Apple dense outputs against the pre-0012 scalar loop (#1116)

Link the production dense kernel and compare 18000 FP32 output bit patterns.
Run the independent reference with identical build flags and contraction
settings. Like wgse_ploidy_check, gate the package target even with
BUILD_TESTING=OFF; also register a dependency-free CTest.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 2b0565b2..3ed846e3 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -66,6 +66,10 @@ list(PREPEND CMAKE_MODULE_PATH "${CMAKE_SOURCE_DIR}/cmake")
 # External dependencies (order matters: protos before nucleus)
 # ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 option(BUILD_TESTING "Build the native tests (fetches GoogleTest)" ON)
+if(APPLE)
+  # The dependency-free scalar-reference gate also runs in package builds.
+  enable_testing()
+endif()
 include(deps)    # FetchContent / find_package for htslib, abseil, protobuf, ssw
 include(protos)  # compile DeepVariant + nucleus + TF-example protos

